#: ../developer/translations.md:1
msgid "Translating the Docs and the Console"
msgstr "翻译文档与控制台"

#: ../developer/translations.md:3
msgid ""
"This page is for translators, and for anyone whose English edit changes "
"translated text. The docs and the console are translated separately: the "
"docs through Sphinx's gettext catalogs, the console through a JSON "
"catalog. Both show English for anything untranslated, and both follow the"
" [terminology tables](#chinese-terminology) at the end."
msgstr ""
"本页面向译者，以及所有在改英文时动到了已有译文的人。文档和控制台分开翻译：文档使用 Sphinx 的 gettext 目录，控制台使用一个 "
"JSON 目录。两者对未翻译的内容都显示英文，并且都遵循文末的[术语表](#chinese-terminology)。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:9
msgid "Translating the docs"
msgstr "翻译文档"

#: ../developer/translations.md:11
msgid ""
"Each translation is attached to one paragraph of English source, not to a"
" whole file, so a partly translated page still builds complete."
msgstr "每条译文挂在一个英文段落上，而不是整个文件上，因此只翻译了一部分的页面也能完整构建。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:21
msgid "A catalog entry pairs the English source with its translation:"
msgstr "消息目录（catalog）里的每条记录，都由英文原文和对应的译文组成："

#: ../developer/translations.md:29
msgid ""
"The English text is the lookup key. After you edit a paragraph, the next "
"`make docs-translate` marks its entry `#, fuzzy`, the build stops using "
"it, and the page shows the English until someone updates the translation."
" Translators only revisit marked entries. Use catalogs, not parallel "
"`.zh.md` files: those drift with no sign that they are out of date."
msgstr ""
"英文原文就是查找键。你修改一个段落后，下一次 `make docs-translate` 会把对应条目标记为 `#, "
"fuzzy`，构建不再使用它，页面会显示英文，直到有人更新译文。译者只需回头处理被标记的条目。请使用翻译目录，不要使用并行的 `.zh.md` "
"文件：那样的文件会悄悄过时，读者也看不出来。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:35
msgid ""
"Commit the `.po` files; `docs/gettext/` is generated and ignored. You do "
"not have to translate a whole page or keep a language complete."
msgstr "提交 `.po` 文件；`docs/gettext/` 是生成的，已被忽略。你不必翻译整页，也不必让某种语言保持完整。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:38
msgid "Traps in Chinese, Japanese and Korean"
msgstr "中文、日文和韩文中的陷阱"

#: ../developer/translations.md:40
msgid "Each of these leaves the build green and the page wrong."
msgstr "下面每一个陷阱都会让构建保持通过，而页面却是错的。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:42
msgid ""
"**A heading that starts with a number is dropped.** MyST re-parses a "
"translated title and reads `1. ` as a list marker. The structure no "
"longer matches the source, so Sphinx emits the English heading, with no "
"warning even under `-W`. Escape the period:"
msgstr ""
"**以数字开头的标题会被丢弃。** MyST 会重新解析翻译后的标题，并把 `1. ` 读成列表标记。结构与原文不再一致，于是 Sphinx "
"输出英文标题，即使在 `-W` 下也没有任何警告。请转义句点："

#: ../developer/translations.md:51
msgid ""
"**In `index.rst`, inline markup that touches a CJK character does not "
"parse.** reStructuredText needs whitespace or certain punctuation before "
"an opening `*`, so `请求的*模型 id*` renders literal asterisks. Separate them "
"with an escaped space, written `\\\\ ` in the catalog:"
msgstr ""
"**在 `index.rst` 中，紧挨 CJK 字符的行内标记无法解析。** reStructuredText 要求开头的 `*` "
"前面是空白或特定的标点，所以 `请求的*模型 id*` 会显示出字面的星号。请用转义空格把它们隔开，在目录中写作 `\\\\ `："

#: ../developer/translations.md:60
msgid ""
"Markdown pages need no such escaping: CommonMark treats a CJK character "
"as neither whitespace nor punctuation, so `**模型 id**` between Chinese "
"characters works."
msgstr ""
"Markdown 页面不需要这种转义：CommonMark 把 CJK 字符既不当作空白也不当作标点，因此夹在中文字符之间的 `**模型 "
"id**` 可以正常工作。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:64
msgid ""
"**In Markdown, a closing `**` after a CJK full stop breaks** when a CJK "
"character follows it, so `**术语。**后文` leaves literal asterisks. Put the "
"full stop outside the bold: `**术语**。后文`."
msgstr ""
"**在 Markdown 中，CJK 句号后面的结束 `**` 会失效**，前提是它后面紧跟 CJK 字符，因此 `**术语。**后文` "
"会留下字面的星号。请把句号放到加粗之外：`**术语**。后文`。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:68
msgid ""
"**A stale `.mo` hides your edits.** Sphinx does not recompile a `.mo` "
"that is newer than its `.po`. Before any verification build, run:"
msgstr "**过期的 `.mo` 会掩盖你的修改。** 如果 `.mo` 比对应的 `.po` 新，Sphinx 不会重新编译它。在做任何验证构建之前，运行："

#: ../developer/translations.md:75
msgid ""
"A fifth problem fails loudly: `make docs-translate` can add `python-"
"format` to an entry marked `no-python-format`, because a string such as "
"`≥ 5%` looks like a format string, and `msgfmt -c` then rejects the pair."
" Delete the added `python-format`."
msgstr ""
"第五个问题会明确报错：`make docs-translate` 可能给标记为 `no-python-format` 的条目加上 `python-"
"format`，因为像 `≥ 5%` 这样的字符串看起来像格式字符串，随后 `msgfmt -c` 会拒绝这对矛盾的标记。删掉新加的 "
"`python-format` 即可。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:80
msgid "Checking the docs"
msgstr "检查文档"

#: ../developer/translations.md:86
msgid ""
"The Docs Build CI job runs the same command. It builds every language "
"with warnings as errors, extracts fresh catalog templates, checks local "
"links, and runs `ops/ci/check_docs_translations.py`. That last step is "
"needed because Sphinx falls back to English for any string it cannot "
"translate, so a page that has quietly reverted still builds clean. It "
"fails on:"
msgstr ""
"Docs Build CI 任务运行的是同一条命令。它以警告即错误的方式构建所有语言，提取新的目录模板，检查本地链接，然后运行 "
"`ops/ci/check_docs_translations.py`。需要最后这一步，是因为 Sphinx "
"对任何无法翻译的字符串都会退回英文原文，所以悄悄退回英文的页面照样能干净地构建。它在以下情况失败："

#: ../developer/translations.md:92
msgid "**fuzzy** entries, which Sphinx does not apply;"
msgstr "**fuzzy** 条目，Sphinx 不会应用它们；"

#: ../developer/translations.md:93
msgid "**missing catalogs**, for a page added without `make docs-translate`;"
msgstr "**缺少消息目录**，即新加了页面却没跑 `make docs-translate`；"

#: ../developer/translations.md:94
msgid ""
"**stale catalogs**: an English edit whose `msgid` no longer matches any "
"entry. This is the commonest case, and it has no `fuzzy` marker;"
msgstr "**过期的目录**：英文修改后，其 `msgid` 不再匹配任何条目。这是最常见的情况，而且没有 `fuzzy` 标记；"

#: ../developer/translations.md:96
msgid ""
"**block starts**: a translation that begins with `1. `, `- `, `# ` or `> "
"`, which re-parses as a list or a heading and is dropped;"
msgstr "**块级开头**：以 `1. `、`- `、`# ` 或 `> ` 开头的译文，会被重新解析成列表或标题而被丢弃；"

#: ../developer/translations.md:98
msgid ""
"**structural divergence**: different counts of `<code>`, `<strong>`, "
"`<em>` and `<a>`, or different inline-code literals and link targets, "
"between a translated page and the English one. This catches the markup "
"traps above."
msgstr ""
"**结构不一致**：翻译页面与英文页面之间 `<code>`、`<strong>`、`<em>` 和 `<a>` "
"的数量不同，或行内代码和链接目标不同。这能发现上面那些标记陷阱。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:102
msgid "How the languages are published"
msgstr "各语言如何发布"

#: ../developer/translations.md:104
msgid ""
"`make docs` builds every language in one `sphinx-build` run. "
"`DOCS_LANGUAGES` in `conf.py` lists them (default "
"`en:English,zh_CN:简体中文`). The first is the root language, at the top of "
"the output tree, so `/routing.html` keeps its URL and the translation is "
"at `/zh_CN/routing.html`. A `build-finished` hook writes each other "
"language to `docs/build/html/<code>/`. The list lives in `conf.py` "
"because the published site is built by a command in the hosting project's"
" settings, where no environment variable can be set."
msgstr ""
"`make docs` 在一次 `sphinx-build` 中构建所有语言。`conf.py` 中的 `DOCS_LANGUAGES` "
"列出这些语言（默认 `en:English,zh_CN:简体中文`）。第一种是根语言，位于输出目录的顶层，因此 `/routing.html` 的"
" URL 保持不变，译文在 `/zh_CN/routing.html`。一个 `build-finished` 钩子把其他每种语言写到 "
"`docs/build/html/<code>/`。语言列表放在 `conf.py` "
"中，是因为发布站点由托管项目设置中的一条命令构建，那里无法设置环境变量。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:112
msgid ""
"The sidebar switcher links to the same page in the other languages and is"
" hidden when only one language is declared. "
"`DOCS_LANGUAGES=\"en:English\"` builds English alone."
msgstr "侧边栏的语言切换器链接到其他语言的同一页面，只声明了一种语言时会隐藏。`DOCS_LANGUAGES=\"en:English\"` 只构建英文。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:116
msgid "Translating the console"
msgstr "翻译控制台"

#: ../developer/translations.md:118
msgid ""
"The console can be read in English or Chinese. A signed-in reader chooses"
" **Language** from the account menu or under **Account Settings**; the "
"choice is kept in the browser and in the account, so it follows them to "
"other browsers. A signed-out reader sees the language last chosen in that"
" browser, or the one the browser asks for. The **Appearance** setting "
"(**Light**, **Dark** or **System**) is saved per browser only."
msgstr ""
"控制台可以用英文或中文阅读。登录的读者在账户菜单或 **账户设置** 中选择 "
"**语言**；这个选择保存在浏览器和账号中，因此会跟随他们到其他浏览器。未登录的读者看到的是该浏览器中最近一次选择的语言，或者浏览器请求的语言。**外观**"
" 设置（**浅色**、**深色** 或 **跟随系统**）只按浏览器保存。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:125
msgid "Writing a console string"
msgstr "编写控制台文案"

#: ../developer/translations.md:127
msgid "Every string a reader sees goes through `t(slot, English)`:"
msgstr "读者看到的每一条文案都经过 `t(slot, English)`："

#: ../developer/translations.md:134
msgid ""
"The English at the call site is the source text. Edit it there; there is "
"no English catalog."
msgstr "调用处的英文就是源文本。直接在那里修改；没有英文目录。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:136
msgid ""
"Name the slot `<area>.<page or component>.<meaning>`, like "
"`auth.login.title` and `chrome.header.dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"slot 命名为 `<area>.<page or component>.<meaning>`，例如 `auth.login.title` 和 "
"`chrome.header.dashboard`。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:138
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Translate whole sentences, and insert values with `fill()` from "
"`@/lib/utils/interpolate`, so another language can reorder them: "
"`fill(t('chrome.account_menu.switched', 'Switched to {name}'), { name "
"})`."
msgstr ""
"翻译完整的句子，并用 `@/lib/utils/interpolate` 中的 `fill()` "
"插入变量，这样其他语言可以调整顺序：`fill(t('chrome.account_menu.switched', 'Switched to "
"{name}'), { name })`。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:141
msgid ""
"In a server component, get the same function, in the request's language, "
"from `await requestTranslator()` (`@/lib/i18n/request.server`)."
msgstr ""
"在服务端组件中，用 `await "
"requestTranslator()`（`@/lib/i18n/request.server`）获得同样的函数，语言与请求一致。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:143
msgid ""
"Format dates and numbers with `useFormatter()` "
"(`@/lib/i18n/useFormatter`), not `toLocaleString()`. Amounts stay in US "
"dollars."
msgstr ""
"日期和数字用 `useFormatter()`（`@/lib/i18n/useFormatter`）格式化，而不是 "
"`toLocaleString()`。金额一律以美元显示。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:145
msgid ""
"Both arguments must be literals (or a `cond ? 'a' : 'b'` of literals), so"
" the catalog check can read them."
msgstr "两个参数都必须是字面量（或由字面量组成的 `cond ? 'a' : 'b'`），字典检查才能读出它们。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:148
msgid "The catalog"
msgstr "字典"

#: ../developer/translations.md:150
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/src/lib/i18n/messages/zh-CN.json` maps each slot to the "
"English it translates and the translation:"
msgstr "`apps/frontend/src/lib/i18n/messages/zh-CN.json` 把每个 slot 映射到它所翻译的英文以及译文："

#: ../developer/translations.md:157
msgid ""
"An entry is used only while its `source` matches the English the call "
"site passes, so a changed sentence shows the new English until it is "
"translated again. A slot that passes different English in different "
"places holds a list of entries, one per string. Only the active "
"language's catalog is sent to the browser."
msgstr ""
"只有当条目的 `source` 与调用处传入的英文一致时，才会使用该条目，因此修改过的句子会显示新的英文，直到重新翻译。同一个 slot "
"在不同位置传入不同英文时，它包含一个条目列表，每个字符串一条。只有当前语言的目录会发送到浏览器。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:170
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Missing and stale entries fall back to English. The test suite "
"(`src/lib/i18n/catalog.test.ts`) fails on a malformed entry, on a "
"translation whose `{placeholders}` differ from its source, and on stale "
"or orphaned entries in a shipped catalog, so re-translate or prune in the"
" same change that edits the English."
msgstr ""
"缺失和过期的条目会退回英文。测试套件（`src/lib/i18n/catalog.test.ts`）在以下情况失败：条目格式错误、译文的 "
"`{placeholders}` 与源文本不同，以及已发布目录中存在过期或孤立的条目。因此请在修改英文的同一个改动中重新翻译或清理。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:176
msgid ""
"The Terms of Service and the research-consent statements at sign-up are "
"translated in full and shown in Chinese alone. Because they are binding, "
"an edit to their English must come with its translation in the same "
"change."
msgstr "服务条款和注册时的研究同意声明全文翻译，并且只显示中文。由于它们具有约束力，修改其英文时必须在同一个改动中附上译文。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:180
msgid "What stays in English"
msgstr "保留英文的内容"

#: ../developer/translations.md:182
msgid ""
"Pages only the people running the deployment see: administration "
"(`/dashboard/admin`), first-run setup (`/setup`), and the API Playground,"
" which only internal accounts can open. The admin layout provides an "
"English `LocaleProvider` with no catalog and marks its container "
"`lang=\"en\"`, and admin dates use the `en-US` locale."
msgstr ""
"只有运营部署的人才会看到的页面：管理后台（`/dashboard/admin`）、首次运行设置（`/setup`），以及只有内部账号能打开的 "
"API Playground。管理后台的布局提供一个不带目录的英文 `LocaleProvider`，并把容器标记为 "
"`lang=\"en\"`；管理后台的日期使用 `en-US` 区域设置。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:187
msgid ""
"The last-resort error screens (`global-error` and the boundary around the"
" whole application), which render outside the language provider."
msgstr "最后兜底的错误页（`global-error` 以及包住整个应用的错误边界），它们渲染在语言 provider 之外。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:189
msgid ""
"Error messages from the gateway, model names, and Markdown written by "
"administrators (broadcasts, site updates)."
msgstr "网关返回的错误信息、模型名称，以及管理员撰写的 Markdown 内容（广播、站点更新）。"

#: ../developer/translations.md:192
msgid "Chinese terminology"
msgstr "中文术语"

#: ../developer/translations.md:194
msgid ""
"Use the same Chinese for an English term everywhere, and define a new "
"term in the [Glossary](glossary.md) first. Terms that stay in English are"
" written in English in the Chinese text too."
msgstr "同一个英文术语在所有地方使用同一个中文译法；新术语请先在[术语表](glossary.md)中定义。保留英文的术语，在中文文本中也写作英文。"

